    <model-tier>sonnet</model-tier>
    <model-tier-reason>Complex-but-fully-specified per DS-1b/DS-4's precise API surface (ImportSolution/StageAndUpgrade actions + ImportJob polling) with a well-defined 8-solution dependency order already shipped -- Sonnet @ xhigh.</model-tier-reason>
